---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: For Business
description: "A flexible 3D production partner for UK businesses — batch discounts, sample approval, QC checks, invoices and PO support."
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Bondar Labs · For Business</p>
    <h1>For Business</h1>
    <p class="lead">A professional multi-printer setup with the flexibility of a small partner — fast iterations, reliable repeat runs, and clear communication.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-body prose">
          <h2>What we support</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Invoices provided</li>
            <li>Purchase orders accepted</li>
            <li>NDA available on request</li>
            <li>Sample approval available</li>
            <li>Repeat production supported</li>
            <li>Batch discounts available</li>
            <li>Quality checks before dispatch</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Use cases</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Prototype iterations and fit validation</li>
            <li>Fixtures, jigs, housings and functional parts</li>
            <li>Small-batch production for product lines</li>
          </ul>

          <p class="muted">Thousands of completed prints across multiple product lines.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="kicker">Fast start</div>
          <h2 class="h3">Send a file and requirements</h2>
          <p class="muted">We’ll recommend the best process/material and quote quickly. If you don’t have a file, we can help design or recreate it.</p>

          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/quote/">Get a Quote</a>
            <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/services/batch-production/">Batch production</a>
          </div>

          <div class="card mt-12">
            <div class="card-body">
              <div class="kicker">Need a call?</div>
              <p class="muted" style="margin:8px 0 12px">Call or WhatsApp to discuss requirements and timelines.</p>
              <div class="hero-actions">
                <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="tel:{{ company.phoneE164 }}" data-track="phone_click">Call</a>
                <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="{{ company.whatsappUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="whatsapp_click">WhatsApp</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
